<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13204" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπομερισμός</span></b> , ὁ,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπονομή</span>
			, of water from an aqueduct, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ephes.</u>
				2
			</span></i> No.<i><span class="en">
				18
			</span></i><span class="entity">(i A.D.)</span>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
			
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπόδραγμα</span>
			, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>fragmentation,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐ γὰρ ἀ. τοῦ παράγοντος τὸ
					παραγόμενον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Procl.
					<u>Inst.</u>
					27
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>division,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς ψυχῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Herm.
					<u>in Phdr.</u>
					p.166A.
				</span></i>
			
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>banishment,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλλογίμων ἀνδρῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Cat.Cod.Astr.</u>
					8(3).185.25
				</span></i>
			, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>5.</b>
			
				v.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιμερίζω</span>
			 (q.v.), Vett. Val.<i><span class="en">
				164.19
			</span></i>, al.</div>
